      "content": "it's just that \"moving forward\" feels like a joke. what am i even moving forward toward? more of this? more of pretending everything is okay when it's clearly not? it feels like i've been running a race for years and i've already lost. i'm just so sick of the constant effort of existing. it feels like there's no actual way to find peace, just more fighting.",
